    "radius_m": 1800.0,
    "length_m": 68.632238,
    "grade_in_pct": 4.6,
    "grade_out_pct": 0.787098,
    "speed_forward_kmh": 114.7,
    "speed_reverse_kmh": 122.0,
    "vertical_acceleration_g": 0.065,
    "note": "The top of La Rampa. Half-length 34.32 m against 101.51 m of climb before it and 59.51 m of shelf after, so it ends 25.19 m before T4's turn-in and 10.7 m before T4's braking point. 2.05x forward and 1.81x reverse. Sight distance over it is sqrt(2R)(sqrt(0.75) + sqrt(0.15)) = 75.9 m, which at 125.4 km/h is 2.18 s: the corner is late, not hidden, and this document does not claim otherwise."
   }
  ],
